==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Whatever [[remain]]s after something else has been [[removed]].
# {{chemistry}} The [[substance]] that remains after [[evaporation]], [[distillation]], [[filtration]] or any similar process.
# Whatever [[property]] or [[effect]]s are left in an [[estate]] after payment of all debts, other charges and deduction of  what is specifically [[bequeathed]] by the [[testator]].
# {{mathematics}} A form of [[complex number]].

====Derived terms====
* [[residual]]
* [[residuary]]

